      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It sounds like you're experiencing a profound sense of obsolescence, and that feeling is incredibly heavy. Please know that your deep skills and the dedication you poured into your craft hold immense value, even if the landscape has shifted. Instead of seeing it as being left behind, perhaps consider how those foundational skills can be translated into something new—a unique perspective that the algorithm-driven world might actually lack. Don't let the perceived end of a path dictate the end of your worth.",
